      "id": "systems-anatomy",
      "name": "Systems Anatomy: Seeing Systems as Living Flows",
      "description": "Learn to see Comptia Infra as living systems \u2014 not static diagrams, but moving sequences where every part connects. Master systems thinking for exams and interviews.",
      "icon": "\ud83d\udd2c",
