        "Type exactly: echo linux-permissions ready \u2014 echo prints your concept token back verbatim",
        "Type exactly: ls \u2014 the listing shows lab-notes (run 'mkdir lab-notes' first if it is missing)",
        "In your own words, say what each command's output taught you about linux permissions."
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "command_pattern": "uname",
          "expect_contains": "Linux",
          "hint": "In the Terminal tab, run `uname`. If the check fails, confirm you typed it exactly and that the output contains \"Linux\"."
        },
        {
          "command_pattern": "echo",
          "expect_contains": "linux-permissions",
          "hint": "In the Terminal tab, run `echo linux-permissions ready`. If the check fails, confirm you typed it exactly and that the output contains \"linux-permissions\"."
        },
        {
          "command_pattern": "^ls$|^ls\\s",
          "expect_contains": "lab-notes",
          "hint": "In the Terminal tab, run `ls`. If the check fails, confirm you typed it exactly and that the output contains \"lab-notes\"."
        }
      ],
      "success_message": "Lab complete \u2014 linux permissions practiced hands-on. That's the Interstitium Labs way: run it, see it, own it."
    },
